<title>USA: AMEX to begin trading 10 options on April 29.</title>
<headline>AMEX to begin trading 10 options on April 29.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The American Stock Exchange said Monday it would list options on 10 stocks beginning Tuesday.</p>
<p>The options would be on shares of Coleman Co Inc, Consolidated Cigar Holdings Inc, Genesco Inc, Advanced Digital Information Corp, CellNet Data Systems Inc, Interface Inc, International Network Services, REMEC Inc, Silicon Gaming Corp and UroHealth Systems Inc.</p>
<p>((--Derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
